sequenceDiagram
  participant B as browser
  participant A as auth (memory)
  participant R as GitLab rooms
  participant C as git clone (disk)
  participant G as GitLab
  B->>A: sign in (read_api, write_repository)
  B->>R: join, edit, save
  R->>A: a token of this user (refreshed)
  R->>G: REST: role, can_push
  R->>C: fetch, build the commit
  C->>G: git fetch, push (the token in this call only)
